# A measurement, not a test (docs/tg-window-report.md): the view's cost with a long
# history. The sample's `Project archive` (1000 messages) is opened, every page loaded
# (Home in the messages, 24 times), and then: a new tree three times over (the summary's
# card opened and closed), whose first frame tg times, and the wheel over the messages
# for the paint times. Scale as the run says.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
click 552 722
serial tg: login phone
pause 1500
click 500 119
pause 500
type 0000\r
then tg: login code
type 12345\r
then tg: login password
type zoraya\r
then tg: ready
click 200 162
pause 300
type archive
then tg: chats 1 from 0: "Project archive"
key ret
key ret
then tg: opened "Project archive": 40 messages
# From the composer back to the messages.
chord shift tab
chord shift tab
key home
then tg: older 40, 80 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 120 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 160 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 200 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 240 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 280 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 320 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 360 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 400 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 440 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 480 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 520 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 560 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 600 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 640 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 680 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 720 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 760 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 800 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 840 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 880 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 920 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 960 loaded
key home
then tg: older 40, 1000 loaded
pause 1000
# The card: a new tree, and another when it closes.
key tab
key ret
then tg: first frame of a new tree:
serial tg: summary unread done:
key esc
then tg: first frame of a new tree:
chord shift tab
key ret
then tg: first frame of a new tree:
serial tg: summary unread done:
key esc
then tg: first frame of a new tree:
chord shift tab
key ret
then tg: first frame of a new tree:
key esc
then tg: first frame of a new tree:
# At the oldest messages, then the wheel down and up for the paint times.
wheel 700 350 down 30
wheel 700 350 up 30
wheel 700 350 down 30
wheel 700 350 up 30
wheel 700 350 down 30
wheel 700 350 up 30
pause 1000
shot layout-1000
